<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants continue attacks on civilians around Macomia, limiting humanitarian access, while peasant farmers flee fields in fear of insurgents. Opposition leader Mondlane reported state abuses during a Supreme Court trial, and the government is pursuing a large LNG megaproject and DP World port expansion. A campaign to mobilise people to &amp;quot;take power&amp;quot; is being used to influence decisions, and land-mine clearance efforts in Zimbabwe are threatened by aid cuts. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE1xNkxaRW04RWpkc1RrOV9zNW1GeGVWVUlxdEVWSzlGTHJSRi13enF4S2QyOElKcktSazdzYWFmNl9Kbkh6dVpBQmVWTG44akV3NkFxUGhpVzVpTjhaaGtNbnZWZl9ZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE43WjBkMDNaQUpBbXhWdWxobTNnbnBrSUplaC1PM0xGQ2hFRmdTbnFxNUxxRXJ6c2doSFpobXdxTVpDVkRMQW5RUURsUThRWUhMbDFUcjhFb1FIWUR0Rmc5c25CT1BCMXhvZUZjSmRiUUR2Rjd4bzB6OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Oz Arab Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNM1RwNFlENnl5ZGtxSE0yS3hiOUs2WEoycFpkZjZzbGpybXBxbFRhZ1dSN0tEVFlDUFh3RDRrUzhsNXIyc0ZoTk1fNnd2OTVQYXhfdDRONHo0a3hxUUlXN3hyS3lfT0xIVDJocUhiNWhsS0VrTXNDUldnQko4VjV1eDA5RExQbWhFd0JDMGlNMHQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Macau Business&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOLWVUcEFveDZlQ3lsN2hDOU1rRUxHUFYtN1hvc3l6c2UwZmg4NURSZnltdm0wX1lkRC15bTZwRHFPUk5jNTlQWkJONHp3akRUcHFtbHN5SWhJb0lBNXZ0SUpySmVUeHJJVkg3SlJteWtybHgxQU9OOHdZcjVpd0JxSmg4cnhYWlpsMGRzVVh0RXBJR0dZbktDbzRQcmY2UzVvZFdxSm80UU9iUEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOVWNQbXNkZEFXR3M2TzFRVERqOGQ0UjVOVmk2ajJ1TlFobmp6aUhxVXhlSXVVTzRLU0tQdFRuTndWNy1VZE5o